Sval: the extension refusal doorhanger is one of the add-on notifications

SvalExtensionCompat says why an install was refused in a doorhanger on the
extensions button. gUnifiedExtensions.getPopupAnchorID logs an error for a
doorhanger there whose id gXPInstallObserver.NOTIFICATION_IDS does not
list, and the list is what removeAllNotifications takes down when a page
enters full screen. The list is a literal in browser-addons.js.

diff --git a/browser/base/content/browser-addons.js b/browser/base/content/browser-addons.js
index 9e0aed5c95..efe5cc2113 100644
--- a/browser/base/content/browser-addons.js
+++ b/browser/base/content/browser-addons.js
@@ -1222,6 +1222,8 @@ var gXPInstallObserver = {
     "addon-progress",
     "addon-webext-permissions",
     "xpinstall-disabled",
+    // Sval: SvalExtensionCompat's refusal of an extension Sval cannot run.
+    "sval-install-refused",
   ],
 
